OL,3,GNEWSANew Brexit deal 'won't solve' all
OL,4,Aissues, but is a 'step in the right
OL,5,Adirection'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new deal between the UK and the EU on
OL,8,Ffood, plants and animals will "make a
OL,9,Freal positive difference for consumers,
OL,10,Fbusinesses and farmers" in Northern
OL,11,FIreland Stormont's agriculture minister
OL,12,Fhas said.
OL,14,FThe agreement was confirmed on Friday
OL,15,Fafternoon when Prime Minister Andy
OL,16,FBurnham met European Commission
OL,17,FPresident Ursula von der Leyen in
OL,18,FBrussels.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
