OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew Brexit deal 'won't solve' all
OL,4,Aissues, but is a 'step in the right
OL,5,Adirection'
OL,6,
OL,7,FSince Brexit, Northern Ireland has
OL,8,Fcontinued to follow EU rules for
OL,9,Fagri-food products while the rest of
OL,10,Fthe UK has not.
OL,12,FThe new deal will see the whole UK
OL,13,Frealigning with EU rules on those
OL,14,Fproducts, meaning goods being sent from
OL,15,FGB to NI will no longer need to be
OL,16,Fchecked at ports.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
